/**
 * Administrator-only stock changes, newest first. All filters combine with AND and persist across cursor pages. Product and author IDs match exactly against saved audit snapshots, including deleted products. Dates are inclusive calendar days in Europe/Warsaw; dateFrom must not exceed dateTo. Preview changes use the shared anonymous preview-admin label, never a session identifier.
 */
